-Desktop 1.2.0 adds manual local-file Wi-Fi OTA for firmware 0.10.6.6 / OTA v1, PC clock synchronization over USB or Wi-Fi, device NTP settings and optional connection actions. Media-index and time automation are off by default; timezone follows Windows unless manually selected. Existing USB CDC MPOD1 v4, themes, paced writes and cancellation recovery remain covered by regressions. The firmware's NTP-server extension was added to `..\MonoPod_v0.10.6.6`; original sources were backed up. Legacy Studio and older firmware trees were preserved. No device was flashed or used for OTA/NTP testing in this release. The earlier 32 KiB physical transfer/readback belongs to Desktop 1.1.1.
